tiv"><abbr>prd</abbr></ref>:</hi> hit þryf~ sy <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ordal</ref> 2 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Dativ"><abbr>dt</abbr></ref>:</hi> þam þryfealdan ordale <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 4 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:B">B</ref> (þrimf-<ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sic"><abbr>!</abbr></ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:H">H</ref>; þreof- <ref type="lawCode" target="law:So">So</ref>). 5 (þreof- <ref type="lawCode" target="law:So">So</ref>). <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1,1 (þreof- <ref type="lawCode" target="law:B">B</ref>; þryfeldan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III</ref> 3,4). 1,4 (= <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30,3). III 7 <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:folgende"><abbr>f.</abbr></ref> V 30 (þrufealdan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:G2">G 2</ref>) = VI 37 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 57; þrimfealdum <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 6,1 (þryf- <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ld">Ld</ref>; þreof- <ref type="lawCode" target="law:So">So</ref>). <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 9 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:substantivirt"><abbr>sbstirt</abbr></ref>:</hi> be þryfealdum (<hi rend="italic">ums Dreifache</hi>) diepan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Blas">Blas</ref> 1; ladige mid þryfealdan <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 41,1 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:accusativus"><abbr>ac</abbr></ref>:</hi> þæt þryfealde ordal 30,3a</dictScrap>
